sequenceDiagram
  participant Teacher as 教师
  participant Ctrl as CourseController/ChapterController
  participant Svc as ChapterService
  participant Repo as ChapterRepository
  participant DB as MySQL 数据库
  Teacher->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/chapters
  Ctrl->>Svc: create(courseId, ChapterCreateRequest, user)
  Svc->>Svc: requireManagePermission(courseId, user)
  Svc->>Svc: validateParent(courseId, parentId)
  Svc->>Repo: nextOrder(courseId, parentId)
  Svc->>Repo: insert(courseId, request, sortOrder)
  Repo->>DB: INSERT crs_chapter
  DB-->>Repo: 返回章节主键
  Repo-->>Svc: Chapter
  Svc->>Repo: updateSortOrder 同级排序
  Svc-->>Ctrl: ChapterResponse
  Ctrl-->>Teacher: 返回章节树
  Teacher->>Ctrl: PUT /api/v1/chapters/{chapterId}
  Ctrl->>Svc: update(chapterId, ChapterUpdateRequest, user)
  Svc->>Repo: ensureNoCycle/update
  Repo-->>Svc: Chapter
  Svc-->>Ctrl: ChapterResponse
